<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Tkenz Record | Official Music & Entertainment</title>

  <meta name="description" content="Tkenz Record is a Nigerian music brand focused on creativity, original music, artist development and entertainment.">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    header {
      background: #000;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 180px;
      max-width: 80%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    header p {
      color: #bbb;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    nav {
      background: #181818;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 15px 10px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      background: #333;
    }

    section {
      padding: 70px 20px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(#000, #151515);
      padding: 90px 20px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
      color: #ccc;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: white;
      color: black;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 13px 25px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 5px;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: #ddd;
    }

    h2.section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .story,
    .artist-card,
    .music-card,
    .contact-card {
      background: #1b1b1b;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      border: 1px solid #292929;
    }

    .story p {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: #ddd;
    }

    .artist-card {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .artist-card h3 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .artist-card p {
      color: #ccc;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .artist-name {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .music-card {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .music-card h3 {
      font-size: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .music-card p {
      color: #bbb;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .contact-card {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-card p {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #ccc;
    }

    .whatsapp {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #25D366;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 13px 25px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #000;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      color: #888;
      border-top: 1px solid #333;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header h1 {
        font-size: 26px;
      }

      .hero h2 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      nav a {
        font-size: 14px;
        padding: 8px 10px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 50px 15px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <header>
    <img src="tkenz-logo.jpg" alt="Tkenz Record Logo" class="logo">

    <h1>Tkenz Record</h1>

    <p>Music • Artists • Creativity • Entertainment</p>
  </header>


  <!-- NAVIGATION -->
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#story">Our Story</a>
    <a href="#artists">Artists</a>
    <a href="#music">Our Music</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>


  <!-- HOME -->
  <section id="home" class="hero">
    <div class="container">

      <h2>Welcome to Tkenz Record</h2>

      <p>
        A growing Nigerian music brand dedicated to creativity,
        original music, artist development and entertainment.
      </p>

      <a href="#music" class="button">Listen to Our Music</a>

      <a href="#artists" class="button">Meet Our Artist</a>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- OUR STORY -->
  <section id="story">
    <div class="container">

      <h2 class="section-title">Our Story</h2>

      <div class="story">

        <p>
          Tkenz Record is a Nigerian music brand built around creativity,
          originality and a passion for great music. Our vision is to create
          music that connects with people and represents the energy and
          creativity of Africa.
        </p>

        <p>
          The story of Tkenz begins with twins Taiye and Kehinde, who perform
          together as Tkenz. They hail from Ile-Ife, Osun State, Nigeria,
          and were born and raised in Jos, Plateau State.
        </p>

        <p>
          Their educational journey began at G.S.S. Garaku in Kokona
          Local Government Area of Nasarawa State. Their journey later took
          them to Lagos as they continued pursuing their dreams and developing
          their passion for music.
        </p>

        <p>
          Through their experiences, creativity and love for music, Tkenz
          continues to build a unique sound that blends African influences
          with modern music.
        </p>

        <p>
          Tkenz Record was created with a bigger vision: to develop talent,
          release quality music and build a lasting African entertainment
          brand that can connect with listeners around the world.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>
            Our mission is simple: create music, develop talent and build
            a lasting African music brand.
          </strong>
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ARTISTS -->
  <section id="artists">
    <div class="container">

      <h2 class="section-title">Our Artist</h2>

      <div class="artist-card">

        <div class="artist-name">TKENZ</div>

        <h3>Taiye & Kehinde</h3>

        <p>
          Tkenz is a musical duo made up of twin brothers Taiye and Kehinde.
          Together, they bring their individual personalities, experiences
          and creativity into one musical identity.
        </p>

        <p>
          Their sound is influenced by African music, Afropop, Afro-fusion
          and contemporary Nigerian sounds, while their songwriting focuses
          on relatable stories, emotions, love, life and everyday experiences.
        </p>

        <p>
          As Tkenz, the twins continue to grow their artistry and share their
          music with audiences in Nigeria and beyond.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- OUR MUSIC -->
  <section id="music">
    <div class="container">

      <h2 class="section-title">Our Music</h2>

      <div class="music-card">

        <h3>You Luv</h3>

        <p>
          Listen to Tkenz on Spotify and discover our music.
        </p>

        <a
          class="button"
          href="https://open.spotify.com/album/1d2NVu06lj7NMTlJcUBQO"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Listen on Spotify
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section id="contact">
    <div class="container">

      <h2 class="section-title">Contact Us</h2>

      <div class="contact-card">

        <p>
          For music, bookings, collaborations and enquiries,
          connect with Tkenz Record.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +234 811 234 5890
        </p>

        <a
          class="whatsapp"
          href="https://wa.me/2348112345890"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Chat With Us on WhatsApp
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer>

    <p>
      © 2026 Tkenz Record. All Rights Reserved.
    </p>

    <p>
      Music • Creativity • Entertainment
    </p>

  </footer>

</body>
</html>
